/**
 * Plaid enum values the client and common layers use, declared locally
 * so the browser bundle does not pull in the Plaid Node SDK (see #847).
 *
 * Generated by scripts/generate-plaid-enums.ts from the installed SDK —
 * do not edit by hand. Each enum is a frozen constant object plus the
 * string-literal union of its values. Server code keeps importing
 * `plaid` directly.
 *
 * The remaining `plaid` names the client layer needs (interfaces such as
 * `Transaction` and `AccountBalance`) are type-only here: they are
 * re-exported as types from the SDK, so the bundler erases them and they
 * contribute nothing to the client bundle.
 */

